### Attribution of the 7 failing integration files above (15 tests)
The same 7 files fail with the same 15 FAIL lines when origin/master's
src/lib/rateLimit.ts is swapped in (run before the K-103 change; the set of
FAIL lines was compared again after it and is identical). Causes, none in the
limiter: the harness points GOTRUE_URL at a closed port ("fetch failed" in
gotrueFetch: 2fa-login-gate, mfa-impersonation-postgres, k-041 x2, k-042);
tests/integration/api/zod-validation.test.ts refuses any database but
isaflow_dev / isaflow_test; k104-k105 expects a function owned by
migration_admin and the fixture has it owned by postgres.
Not verified here because of that: k-041 "L4: the accept endpoint caps password
attempts per invitation token" and "L7 ... is refunded too", the two existing
tests that drive checkRateLimit / refundRateLimit through a route.
Not run: the rest of tests/integration (files that do not mention the limiter).
